(5526,2,211,'Match each swap-space concept with its description.','{\"Swap space\":\"A dedicated disk area the OS uses to store pages not currently needed in RAM\",\"Swapped out\":\"A page copied from RAM to swap space to free a physical frame\",\"Present bit = 0\":\"Indicates the page has been moved to disk; the PTE stores the disk address instead of a PFN\"}','{\"Swap space\":\"A dedicated disk area the OS uses to store pages not currently needed in RAM\",\"Swapped out\":\"A page copied from RAM to swap space to free a physical frame\",\"Present bit = 0\":\"Indicates the page has been moved to disk; the PTE stores the disk address instead of a PFN\"}',3,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,3),
(5527,2,211,'Match each page-fault concept with its meaning.','{\"Page fault\":\"An exception raised when a process accesses a valid virtual page not currently in physical memory\",\"Page-fault handler\":\"OS software that locates the missing page on disk and brings it into a free physical frame\",\"Dirty victim page\":\"A page being evicted that must be written back to swap space because it was modified\"}','{\"Page fault\":\"An exception raised when a process accesses a valid virtual page not currently in physical memory\",\"Page-fault handler\":\"OS software that locates the missing page on disk and brings it into a free physical frame\",\"Dirty victim page\":\"A page being evicted that must be written back to swap space because it was modified\"}',3,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,3),
(5528,2,211,'Match each line of the OS page-fault handler pseudocode with its action.','{\"PFN = FindFreePhysicalPage()\":\"Searches for an available physical frame to load the missing page into\",\"DiskRead(PTE.DiskAddr, pfn)\":\"Issues the I\\/O to copy the page from swap space into the physical frame (process blocks)\",\"PTE.present = True; PTE.PFN = PFN\":\"Updates the page table entry so future accesses find the page in memory\"}','{\"PFN = FindFreePhysicalPage()\":\"Searches for an available physical frame to load the missing page into\",\"DiskRead(PTE.DiskAddr, pfn)\":\"Issues the I\\/O to copy the page from swap space into the physical frame (process blocks)\",\"PTE.present = True; PTE.PFN = PFN\":\"Updates the page table entry so future accesses find the page in memory\"}',3,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,3),
(5529,2,211,'Match each page-replacement policy with its eviction criterion.','{\"OPT (Optimal)\":\"Evicts the page that will be referenced furthest in the future\",\"FIFO\":\"Evicts the page that has been in memory the longest\",\"LRU\":\"Evicts the page that has not been used for the longest time\"}','{\"OPT (Optimal)\":\"Evicts the page that will be referenced furthest in the future\",\"FIFO\":\"Evicts the page that has been in memory the longest\",\"LRU\":\"Evicts the page that has not been used for the longest time\"}',3,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,4),
(5530,2,211,'Match each replacement policy with a key property or limitation.','{\"OPT\":\"Impractical for real systems as it requires knowledge of future page references\",\"FIFO\":\"Suffers from Belady\'s Anomaly - adding more frames can increase the miss rate\",\"Clock (second-chance) algorithm\":\"Approximates LRU using a use bit in each PTE; Linux uses an enhanced version\"}','{\"OPT\":\"Impractical for real systems as it requires knowledge of future page references\",\"FIFO\":\"Suffers from Belady\'s Anomaly - adding more frames can increase the miss rate\",\"Clock (second-chance) algorithm\":\"Approximates LRU using a use bit in each PTE; Linux uses an enhanced version\"}',3,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,4),
(5531,2,211,'For the OPT trace (cache=3, string: 0,1,2,0,1,3,0,3,1,2,1), match each access with its outcome.','{\"Access to page 2 (3rd access, cache={0,1})\":\"Miss - cold start; cache becomes {0,1,2}\",\"Access to page 3 (6th access, cache={0,1,2})\":\"Miss - page 2 evicted (used furthest in future); cache becomes {0,1,3}\",\"Access to page 2 (10th access, cache={0,1,3})\":\"Miss - page 3 evicted; cache becomes {0,1,2}\"}','{\"Access to page 2 (3rd access, cache={0,1})\":\"Miss - cold start; cache becomes {0,1,2}\",\"Access to page 3 (6th access, cache={0,1,2})\":\"Miss - page 2 evicted (used furthest in future); cache becomes {0,1,3}\",\"Access to page 2 (10th access, cache={0,1,3})\":\"Miss - page 3 evicted; cache becomes {0,1,2}\"}',3,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,4),
